sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant CALLER as Caller
    participant TR as BPF trampoline
    participant ENTRY as fentry program
    participant FN as vfs_read body
    participant EXIT as fexit program
    participant MAP as starts map<br/>(tid → timestamp)
    participant RB as ringbuf

    CALLER->>TR: vfs_read(file, buf, count, pos)
    Note over TR: saves original args, fentry runs before body
    TR->>ENTRY: typed args from BTF
    ENTRY->>MAP: store tid + ktime_get_ns()
    Note over MAP: state: one in-flight read for this TID
    ENTRY-->>TR: return 0, tracing side effect complete
    TR->>FN: call original vfs_read
    FN-->>TR: ssize_t ret
    Note over TR: fexit ctx = original args + ret as last slot
    TR->>EXIT: file, buf, count, pos, ret
    EXIT->>MAP: lookup and delete tid
    Note over EXIT: delete prevents stale entries for reused TIDs
    EXIT->>RB: submit duration, ret, comm
    TR-->>CALLER: return original ret
